{
  "title": "DocumentHistory",
  "description": "The schema history of one persisted document type: its version range, its migrations and the upgrade path through them. The version graph is checked on construction and every problem is reported at once (see DocumentSchemaError). Reading never interprets a newer or a discontinued version; see DocumentVersionError.",
